    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just not just a \"heavy burden\" though. it's like... it's constant. everytime i think i can finally just breathe, something else happens to remind me that i dont actually belong here. it feels like i'm playing a game where the rules are rigged against me and no matter how hard i play, i'm always gonna lose. how am i supposed to just \"keep going\" when the cost of living is literally just constant pain?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
