      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Dealing with constant struggle that feels inescapable is profoundly draining, and the feeling that the rules are rigged against you is a terrifying weight to bear. What you are describing is more than just tiredness; it sounds like deep, chronic struggle. Please consider reaching out to a crisis hotline—they are equipped to listen to the depth of this pain without judgment. Talking to someone trained can offer immediate support and a different perspective on how to navigate this immense difficulty.",
      "source": "target",
